-- iPad apps via Audio4c USB MIDI.
--
-- Naming asymmetry on the Audio4c USB MIDI link:
--   Mac-side port name:  "AUDIO4c USB2"   (space, digit 2)
--   iPad-side source:    "AUDIO4c-USB1"   (hyphen, digit 1)
-- These describe the SAME physical link — the host and device ends just
-- name it differently. Mappings authored on the iPad side reference the
-- iPad-side string (via Patterning's MIDI Learn capture); the Mac-side
-- string is what we send to here, since link-spike opens CoreMIDI
-- destinations by their Mac-visible names.
--
-- iPad-Patterning, when run as an AU plugin inside AUM, sees AUM-routed
-- MIDI as midiSource = "AU HOST INPUT" (all caps, spaces). The
-- corresponding iPad-side .patterningMIDIMapping must use that exact
-- string. The Mac-side equivalent uses "Patterning 3" (Patterning's own
-- virtual MIDI port). Cross-platform mapping migration is a sed of
-- "Patterning 3" → "AU HOST INPUT".
--
-- Currently only Track 1 Trigger is learned on iPad. Once the full
-- mapping is migrated (script: copy PurerlTidal.patterningMIDIMapping,
-- substitute the midiSource strings, install on iPad), the same
-- channel-per-track + notes 60–72 vocabulary as patterning3.tidal will
-- light up.

-- lat 50 = aum-au-path
-- See docs/calibration-components.md for the canonical component
-- definition, and docs/calibration-log.md for the measurement record.
-- Hypothesis (untested): the same component value applies to any AU
-- instrument hosted in AUM and reached via A4C USB MIDI — Laplace,
-- Patterning 3 AUv3, etc. Validate by re-measuring with a different AU
-- before assuming.
midi-device ipad-patterning "AUDIO4c USB2" lat 50

-- ─── Track triggers (iPad-Patterning) ─────────────────────────────────
-- Calibration anchor: note 60 ch 1 → Track 1 Trigger, learned 2026-05-01.
-- Other tracks pending full mapping migration; uncomment as the iPad
-- mapping grows.
bind ipad-p3-1 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 60 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-2 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 62 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-3 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 64 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-4 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 65 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-5 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 67 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-6 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 69 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-7 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 71 100 200
-- bind ipad-p3-8 midi-note ipad-patterning 1 72 100 200
